abstract: >-
  An agent skill for finding, building, evaluating, and improving systems
  with decision models across software, business, organizations, and life.
  Applies composition and classical decision methods while keeping exact work, policy,
  and authority explicit. TypeSafe Jev is the default hosted exemplar.
  Independent of TypeSafe.
